{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d363d8a58c07fe508a6967f4badcf086acc0420bd8b5e56b754deeb0e95ba87f", "ja": "貴音はロコに世界の真実を話す。それは、一\n定周期で訪れる大忘却。そして貴音たち司書\nのみがその耐性を持つという事実。ロコは\n貴音に共に島を出ようと伝え、貴音も決断\nする。しかしその行く手を千早が阻んだ。", "zh": "贵音向ROCO讲述了世界的真相。那就是，定期到来的大遗忘，以及只有贵音她们这些图书管理员拥有抵抗力这一事实。ROCO告诉贵音一起离开这座岛，贵音也下定了决心。然而，千早阻挡在了她们前进的路上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "9579484c0dd716395590c9a281ee039e98a5fc4dd720f08daaff994c30aeca5b", "ja": "……わかりました、みちこ。一つだけ。\nこの世界の真実を、貴女に話しましょう。", "zh": "……我明白了，路子。就只说一个。\n关于这个世界的真相，就由我来告诉您吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "2dcb79dae50f7507858682740bd0db4d0c30fac7c1e8f4ec5faa45c294237e09", "ja": "この世界……セプテムアーク人工島では、\n一定の周期で、記録、記憶の消失が起こります。", "zh": "在这个世界……塞普特姆方舟人工岛上，\n会以固定的周期发生记录、记忆的消失。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "648d28a24c88c68f71d80b1a00176f8ec45bacb864988adc9fbfd5dc7ab122fe", "ja": "それは抗うことのできない、絶対的な『大忘却』……\n人々は全てを忘れ、忘れたことすら忘れてしまう。", "zh": "那是无法抗拒的、绝对的“大遗忘”……\n人们会忘记一切，甚至连自己忘记过也会忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "dd9b6427db1d9200640b4214a22d0b265ef7ad622d66f116ddf38ca9c5562848", "ja": "えっ……え？　大忘却？　えっ……！？", "zh": "诶……诶？大忘却？诶……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "3d6ac8a90e96dd36814bff027db8278961511b42f02fb553f00ea2a50440672f", "ja": "そして、私たち司書は、その忘却に耐性を持つ者……\n大切な記録を後世に残すための、生きた本なのです。", "zh": "因此，我们这些图书管理员，便是能够抵御那场遗忘的人……\n为了将重要的记录留给后世，我们就是活着的书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "878ab574818141c401327911e8c25473e418d8fa9a0295fa60c8a937a83dcd24", "ja": "シャドウバウトの試合数が一定数を超えた時、\n大忘却は起こります。それは、もうすぐそこまで……。", "zh": "当暗影对决的比赛场次超过一定数量时，大忘却就会发生。那一刻，已经近在眼前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "64e548e70fd0289889b3c2146356b4c7e261a29f3fb9a8095aa2ee01147821fb", "ja": "ですから、全ては無意味なのです。\nせめて心安らかに、その時を迎えましょう。みちこ。", "zh": "所以，一切都是没有意义的。至少，让我们平静地迎接那一刻吧，美智子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "650ecaabccd2872a2070e6e2d00bda48c88fe7f5e2d6e852851d7d37793cc717", "ja": "そ、そんなこと言われても、ロコは……\nロコはディスアグリーメントです！", "zh": "可、可就算你这么说，ROCO……  \nROCO可是不同意的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "3ffce16dfc00351917ab6ab8f5a1a83773a608e69c6d8baae9268be7a7f7739e", "ja": "タカネが寂しそうにしている理由、わかりましたよ！\nみんなに忘れられて、自分だけが置いていかれて……", "zh": "我明白贵音为什么会显得那么寂寞了！\n被大家遗忘，只有自己被留在了原地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "b989ba8800910d051151821ad2ab3218c3ccdb374b3da6451d0948bd39c5fc13", "ja": "ロコがやるべきなのは、諦めることじゃないです！\n大忘却を乗り越える方法を、リサーチしなきゃ！", "zh": "ROCO该做的不是放弃！而是要调查克服大遗忘的方法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "48d5ad38b411f3f11dd1d39a27681596e35a860993e1e0452d844c0769916da8", "ja": "っ！　そんな……無謀です、みちこ。\n深青書院にも、方法など伝わっていないのに……。", "zh": "！怎么会……太乱来了，美知子。\n就连深青书院都没有流传下任何方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "662889e0e4b00c0e3c31f53c635f658ae7909528eac90c07397f1049dbe5db47", "ja": "だから探すんです！　タカネも一緒に行きましょう？\nさあ、ロコの手を取って！　ここを出るんです！", "zh": "所以才要去寻找啊！贵音也一起来吧？\n来，牵起ROCO的手！我们要离开这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "deaebb247fa0bb39364b0837004b0b0d43047455a5349c0c154899f3c33dd5de", "ja": "深青を……出る……？　私が……？", "zh": "离开深青……？我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "4f59de4ee3350e24cc7314cdc1e8b4d39c1794832cc034c1ee940a5d9210835c", "ja": "伴田さん、そこまでにしてもらえるかしら？", "zh": "伴田小姐，能请你到此为止吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "d8d317677ae1ded44942e6ee50a71acaf3a5fff85483aaa22c77123894ac8c34", "ja": "千早……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "c714e3be3f5cfbef9baa8069d7938398ff0eedb56a3c5525a656be47bf50dab6", "ja": "四条さん、お願い。よく考えて。", "zh": "四条同学，求你了。仔细想想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "3277b270b75b44dc7351a88d6d208427000d259ad786ee397e1215916927b310", "ja": "……ごめんなさい、千早。\nみちこ、参りましょう！", "zh": "……对不起，千早。\n美智子，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "59c1ce5ccf842cbeae1792604a9e14bbfa8573adf37136d1583e88c1abcbc252", "ja": "は、はい、タカネ！", "zh": "是、是的，贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "e1e247170c6fca96b2be8eb50f27f6bcb7877b170c1356f2099a771fa892c50d", "ja": "……。四条さん……そう。\nそれが、貴女の選択なのね……。", "zh": "……四条小姐……这样啊。\n这就是你的选择啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "7f7adcfbbfde662bc251a4cc0c4a20040305b1c32f8f622c05e2f617e36a01e9", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……ひとまず、ヘリオトロープに……", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……先到天芥菜那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "6855c6a5b12cf202e636e7e9971bcc880ef80995b37623a35d4fe6ff5bdd4866", "ja": "待っていましたわよ、コロちゃん！\nそして……貴音姫！", "zh": "我一直在等你们呢，小可洛！\n还有……贵音姬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "1ea6dddc272dd2f25d26517ffe66bc06d55b4a8221f533cc2a5fecf288185f93", "ja": "チヅル！？　シズカも……。", "zh": "千鹤！？静香也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "0405b216220262f8e6abd7c60801a0c8c89d031d23119f10fb1ff71a316851b5", "ja": "千早さんから連絡があったの。\nあなたが貴音さんを連れ出したって。", "zh": "千早联系我了。\n她说是你把贵音带出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "f7f8e90f5767a165156dac56dfa129db3aac3df8591c81cf6f11c991ccce6bd9", "ja": "コロちゃんから離れなさい、貴音姫！\n幼気なコロちゃんをたぶらかして、承知しませんわよ！", "zh": "离CORO远一点，贵音公主！你竟敢蛊惑年幼天真的CORO，我可不会放过你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "cb953fd3241c9c4014c3a629fb5595565045ff98ba6184cadf8608dec1e38c3d", "ja": "たぶらかすとは、随分な物言いですね。\n私とみちこは、深い信頼で繋がっているというのに。", "zh": "居然说是迷惑，真是相当失礼的说法呢。\n明明我和美智子是以深厚的信赖联系在一起的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "42586c64c7df84929fb82a3b416bc3758143be25cd9f4563f6cac3cadc1c9ebe", "ja": "わたくしの方が、昔から仲良しですわよ！\n何がみちこですか！　コロちゃんはコロちゃんですわ！", "zh": "我才是从很久以前起就和她关系要好的那一个！  \n什么“美智子”啊！小可就是小可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "a1143800a9e2db30a6eb82eae072b3dadf43a64e5745cc27416d59febd341eee", "ja": "ぐぬぬぬ……絶対、貴女になど渡しませんわ！\nこうなれば、シャドウバウトで決着を……！", "zh": "呜呜呜……我绝对不会把她交给你的！\n既然如此，就用Shadow Bout一决胜负……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "f67153a94a43f232f8156dcf61cac56f4f3ee12f418f69a77e463682af16d9f2", "ja": "どっちも違いますし、ストップ、ストップです～！\nふたりとも、ヒートアップしないでください！", "zh": "你们两个都不对，停下，停下啦～！\n两位，请不要越来越激动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "6db0433601557257f1724c256658a1f7fd3a0551c3f44ac0deead50d1f9b61a4", "ja": "戦ってはいけないんです、大忘却が～！", "zh": "不可以战斗啊，大忘却要来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "84beef91fa77752b043cbcdb96ae0b7b880c94e22da17548db0f38f5e8e5c6e5", "ja": "そ、そんな……わたくし達が、\n忘却を繰り返しているですって……！？", "zh": "怎、怎么会……我们一直在重复遗忘……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "d61b149204670f016e7eab13a6999055d684e357891cf555b74f8d7ee4ff72d4", "ja": "うそ……そんな、私……。\nダメ、忘れるわけにはいかないの、私は……！", "zh": "不……怎么会，我……  \n不行，我不能忘记，我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "9104e28f9ceef61d5f58288fa1bdad3f2163261d30da2a97c01d5eacf5bfb206", "ja": "だって、私、まだ謝ってない……未来に！\nやっと強くなれたのに……それじゃ、なんのために！", "zh": "可是，我还没有向未来道歉……！\n好不容易才变得坚强……那样的话，我到底是为了什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1034_025roc", "source_sha256": "d4670245294e784aab4a48aff59eecaa371d1acf4d87b472167773a7fc271528", "ja": "お、落ち着いてくださいシズカ！　チヅルも……\nだからロコとタカネは、解決策を探しているんです！", "zh": "请、请冷静一点，静香！千鹤也……所以，ROCO和贵音正在寻找解决办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "125e161bbb82c3f00afc9a52f74042fbe45e9700c5a94e45d36b52c12a28900b", "ja": "ないわ、そんなもの。あれば見つけているもの。", "zh": "才没有那种东西。要是有的话，早就找到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1036_008tak", "source_sha256": "c88f723bea52d1f801a497947427a3f8d8f13e6d1db583680ca38a2bf6aed57e", "ja": "っ！　千早……追ってきたのですか！", "zh": "！千早……你追过来了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "ca35902fb5000f603994c50250091839a226f6eecbadeb401a9ad4e03477735d", "ja": "くっ……次から次へと！　ヘリオトロープの敷地内で、\nわたくしを差し置いて好き勝手はさせませんわよ！", "zh": "可恶……一个接一个地来！在赫利俄特洛普的地盘内，我可不会让你们把我撇在一边随心所欲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "aeaaa4ebfc0a048194dc234a797ac3fb40c6c235dd16496685dce8fc12678006", "ja": "私は、深青のエージェントとしてここにいます。\n機密漏えい、司書の脱走により……任務を開始します。", "zh": "我是作为深青的特工来到这里的。\n由于机密泄露、图书管理员逃脱……任务开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1039_002chi", "source_sha256": "da6bd3917bb95d521aa85548fa7b43b4f8090b5d521bf0fa0a76c6c3dc943e47", "ja": "来たれ、面影の代行者。過ぎ去りし者たちの管理人……\n先に生き、永遠を歩む者……ここへ。", "zh": "来吧，面影的代行者。逝去之人的管理者……\n先于此世而生、行走于永恒之人……到这里来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1040_null", "source_sha256": "3b3d80080897c1f7afa10caa5646b1fd6c765217ee9422cddb66b3b1ea5b612e", "ja": "カツン、カツン、カツン……", "zh": "哒、哒、哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "ffa9036e69e748b13683bdc20d7f9c9318b2837a131ff3b53a937f37525d4fa6", "ja": "この足音は……\n千早さん、先生を呼んだんですか！？", "zh": "这个脚步声是……\n\n千早小姐，您把老师叫来了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "4b42daa0aada27e83a1f219bbe9e66d57a40988eb67285aa238dbcba5d424ef6", "ja": "ええ。\nリベンジといきましょう、静香。", "zh": "嗯。\n来复仇吧，静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1043_se", "source_sha256": "a7c55e1fc0169ea4782244a3ef1a2807ecc7877fe66fa71b0c58901f6d3c59f1", "ja": "ブーーーーーーーーーッ！", "zh": "呜————————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1044_025roc", "source_sha256": "0e28b0973b7b6a49dde5d56820c5980541ef5a9b58e93f656492f2d9c5b529d5", "ja": "あ、ああっ、陰界になっちゃいました！", "zh": "啊、啊啊，变成阴界了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1045_sensei", "source_sha256": "4c65b5f17258daea2a0c76a1027b3ef4732996f3010a1058bc2245c9e05e2003", "ja": "やあ、千早。それにみんなも。\n随分古い呪文で召喚されたけど、何か用かな？", "zh": "嗨，千早。还有大家也是。\n虽然是用相当古老的咒语把我召唤出来的，不过是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1046_002chi", "source_sha256": "67eb5c6ac02780bce69cae0cd6f46a0c711343b868d7fc70d8e8fe78a131fc0b", "ja": "私、如月千早は、陰界戦戯による決闘を希求します。\n疾く律令の如く行い給え。", "zh": "我，如月千早，请求以阴界战戏进行决斗。\n速速依律令行之。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "559cbc3a5b7f84f811590bbb17308a6b0c3b77697091182073c5deeea8f28eef", "ja": "ま、待ってください！　どうして！？\n千早さんも、知っているんですよね？", "zh": "请、请等一下！为什么！？\n千早小姐明明也知道的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "ef468607afb92200d96ca273437802931733882c43c93f687a84d29bf7f9f503", "ja": "私たちが今ここで戦えば、記憶のリセットが\n起きてしまうかもしれないって！", "zh": "我们如果现在在这里交战，可能会引发记忆重置，您也知道这件事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "93e26b663b0aa3477df97fe8ec1088ca3ef83d9e02d38c2cfccb239cf264dacc", "ja": "ええ、知っているわ。それが狙いよ。", "zh": "嗯，我知道。那正是我的目的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1050_008tak", "source_sha256": "567647ef1b67d29767c3076f516304dfe8a0d0987bfa8d99b1e97c818768eb33", "ja": "千早。なぜそこまで……？", "zh": "千早。为什么要做到这种地步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1051_002chi", "source_sha256": "bc8a56b9d7c031fa98618de8dc1bd760409f5a695eb34a2aa9bb43202811c370", "ja": "籠の鳥を逃がすくらいなら、無に還した方がいい。\nその方が鳥も、苦しまなくて済むもの。", "zh": "与其让笼中之鸟逃走，不如让它归于虚无。这样一来，鸟儿也不必受苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1052_002chi", "source_sha256": "f8cb11c9cb151021bcc3e534ca500e30d6d44e1758bf4771ace2bed040a6a086", "ja": "先生、さあ早く。", "zh": "先生，快点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1053_sensei", "source_sha256": "b283dbc13a4a96e4ce6ced7042b83998ecb6583bad34a9205b95ac7b0ceb3e69", "ja": "……はは、わかったよ。\nでは、開幕といこう！", "zh": "……哈哈，知道了。\n那么，就让我们拉开序幕吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_05_1054_se", "source_sha256": "be80f7e52bb20fd71d42926c61eb00bacba53c4dcf480f1c5bbdd446355fcbd2", "ja": "ヴンッ！", "zh": "轰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
